fcalc> set echo
fcalc> ! Vectors: rows and columns of values, made, indexed, and computed with.
fcalc> ! A row's elements are parted by commas, a column's by semicolons.
fcalc> v = [1, 2, 3]
v =
  1  2  3
fcalc> w = [4; 5; 6]
w =
  4
  5
  6
fcalc> [2]
2
