  0.785398163397  -0.785398163397
fcalc> round(linspace(0, 1, 3) * 10)
  0  5  10
fcalc> ! The list functions take every element.
fcalc> sum(v)
6
fcalc> prod(v)
6
fcalc> mean([1, 2, 3, 4])
2.5
fcalc> median([5, 1, 3])
3
fcalc> max(v, 10)
